+## README library-only installation option may no longer work with…
+
+Note on library-only installation: With the current `flit_scm`-based build (see `pyproject.toml`), the `tabulate` console entry point is always installed via the unconditional `[project.scripts]` declaration, so the previously documented `TABULATE_INSTALL=lib-only` environment variable is no longer respected and has no effect. If you only need the Python library, install the package normally; the command-line utility will still be added to your environment's `bin`/`Scripts` directory.
